Do not use generic AI dashboard styling. Use ScolaPro tokens, 8-point spacing, approved typography, shadcn/ScolaPro components, Sonner feedback, restrained motion, responsive layouts and explicit loading/error/empty states. Do not expose browser-native select/radio/date-picker/alert/confirm UI in core workflows.